# Harden the Docker build context against common local leak vectors.
# New for this port (the pinned dmac-assistant source did not carry a
# .dockerignore of its own); adapted from docker/cc-runtime/.dockerignore's
# pattern (PLAN-7 Task 3 precedent) for the docker/bedrock-proxy/ context
# root. The real secret env file must NEVER enter the build context -- the
# bearer token is injected only at container runtime via compose `env_file:`
# (gate G6), never baked into the image.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage*
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.prod
**/.env.dev
proxy-secret.env
**/credentials.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa
**/id_rsa.*
.git
.venv
